{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_FightThroughHorde.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Action.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_4pOnlineCoop.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Coop_2.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_Upgrade.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. Improve your character, increase your firepower or try a new weapon. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_Discord.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come and join us in our Discord to discuss the game, talk to the developers, share ideas or report any bugs and issues you may have found.\u00a0 See you there!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552820?t=1742550396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/92b795b84873e1575049b7e34c9f255be29ebb6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742550396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/b229282d983fd8df159a5c0694a02a4f504f765d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742550396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/b229282d983fd8df159a5c0694a02a4f504f765d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742550396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains blood, dismemberment and violence that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_FightThroughHorde.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Action.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_4pOnlineCoop.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Coop_2.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_Upgrade.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. Improve your character, increase your firepower or try a new weapon. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/Description_Discord.png?t=1742550396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come and join us in our Discord to discuss the game, talk to the developers, share ideas or report any bugs and issues you may have found.\u00a0 See you there!</p>","developers":["Bellyflop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shar